OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween event cancelled due to
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's Halloween event that has
OL,7,Fbeen running for 15 years has been
OL,8,Fcancelled because strong winds and
OL,9,Fheavy rain are expected.
OL,11,FThe Spooky Welly Walk was due to take
OL,12,Fplace in Sefton Park, Liverpool, on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FBut the Roy Castle Lung Cancer
OL,16,FFoundation, which organises the family
OL,17,Ffundraiser, said it had made the
OL,18,F"difficult decision" to call it off
OL,19,Fafter the Met Office issued a yellow
OL,20,Fweather warning for the area, with
OL,21,Fstrong winds and heavy rain expected
OL,22,Fdue to Storm Austen.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
